# AI Coach — locked plan

**Implemented** in `tests/API/RAS/aiCoachDashboard.spec.js`. Follow `framework-standards.mdc` + `rules-md`. Do not run org-mutating scripts unless the user asks. This is not CAISY, AI Assistant, or Percipio weekly learning goals.

Chats only if this file is silent: [dashboard](947986f4-b714-4564-816c-1d221fa3a5af) · [APIs](c593d4e5-166e-4632-a455-1f5d1739af13) · [Not started](157ec062-b272-4e82-a09d-a608ef546e9d).

