## Product (short)

Learner: nine-dot → AI Coach. Admin: Analytics → Dashboard → AI Coach (Summary | Assessments). Filters: date range; audience up to 20. Off until Site Settings → AI Coach Settings. Assessment/pulse questions are not customizable. Feedback invites are **email only**. Pulse is not a dashboard widget this phase. Pulse days in script: **60** (`1` returns 500). We do not PATCH email campaigns.

Performance cycle Home task appears **14 days before** each date. Dates at runtime: **today+14d**, **today+1 month**, and **today+2 months**, `YYYY-MM-DD`, never past or today. Missing day → last day of that month.

`client_id` = AI Coach profile id. One per learner, reuse. GET `data` does not return it. GET profile / GET tasks do. PUT profile sends it. Missing → generate once.

