**API 5 answer shape:** checkbox `{ additionalProp1: [choice strings] }` + `other_notes` (null unless Other). Rating `{ additionalProp1: 1–5 }`. Input `{ additionalProp1: "text" }`. Key name is `additionalProp1`.

**API 4 questions:** Q1 checkbox max 3 strengths · Q2 rating 1–5 · Q3 checkbox max 3 actions · Q4 rating 1–5 · Q5 checkbox max 3 skills · Q6 text.

**Home slugs seen:** `request-feedback-from-colleagues`, `set-your-first-goal`, `review-new-insights`.

**Search terms:** `USERCOUNT` A–E → rotate `roleProfiles` plus `poolJobRoles` (Product Manager is one of many, not everyone). Default ready/full → that row’s JSON `jobRole`. POST goal / tasks accept **200 or 201**.

**API 9:** Default users match planned name **exact**, then a catalog name that **contains** it, then another of the 20 names, then any unused catalog skill so all 3 JSON goals still post (title stays JSON). USERCOUNT: GET catalog for **that person’s job role** (cached per role). Use the planned 20-name (or a containing catalog name) if this catalog has it; else another 20-name in the catalog; else any catalog skill so the dashboard still has variety. Do not force every random learner onto Product Manager.

**API 14 notes:** `launch_id` **is** the uuid in `/ai-coach/chat/{uuid}` (same as coaching-session referer). One launch can take **many** blocks — each POST a new body `id` (client UUID). Server `duration_seconds` ≈ `ended_at − started_at`. Close from HAR uses `close_reason: "session_reset"`. Also seen: `surface_inactive`, `idle_timeout`, `page_hidden`. Block `id` is not the launch id. Set `started_at` in the past by planned seconds — do not sleep. First `POST /chat/stream` with `launch_id: null` creates the launch.

**API 15/16 notes:** Referer `/ai-coach/chat/{uuid}` — that uuid is the chat `launch_id`, not the coaching-session `id`. The learner UI shows the session on that chat. Do **not** POST 15 without a real chat uuid. Body uses local time **without** offset + separate `scheduling_timezone` (`Asia/Calcutta`). `recurrence: "weekly"`. `recurrence_weekday`: **0 = Monday**. `duration_minutes: 60`. **Full default users:** one weekly session **per closed chat from this run**. Ready, untouched, and USERCOUNT pool get **no** coaching sessions. Do not PATCH 16.

**Still missing:** dedicated session-topics API, manager/colleague feedback (email). Do not invent those. Topics only appear if the product derives them from chat + session-notes.

