## `@aiCoachDashboard` — `USERCOUNT=N`

```
tenth = floor(N * 0.1)
A     = N - 5 * tenth
```

All N: API 6. **F:** stop (Not started). **A–E:** profile (rotated job role) → assessment → API 8 → GET API 6 again → both flags true → goals/tasks, in batches of 20. Then **one chat** if goal+tasks succeeded, also in batches of 20 (SSE times out if ~90 streams run at once). Stamp group, role, skill, mixIndex, chat script, and duration **before** the profile/goals batches.

| Group | Count           | Assess | Goals | Tasks per goal | Complete tasks | Achieve goal | Chat |
| ----- | --------------- | ------ | ----- | -------------- | -------------- | ------------ | ---- |
| A     | leftover (~50%) | PUT    | 1     | 1              | that 1         | yes          | 1    |
| B     | tenth           | PUT    | 2     | 2              | both           | yes          | 1    |
| C     | tenth           | PUT    | 2     | 2              | 1 of 2         | no           | 1    |
| D     | tenth           | PUT    | 1     | 1              | no             | no           | 1    |
| E     | tenth           | PUT    | 2     | 2              | no             | no           | 1    |
| F     | tenth           | no     | none  | —              | —              | —            | none |

Never “all tasks done, goal still open.” A and D stay at **1 goal**. B, C, E get **2** so Goals set is higher than Users who set goals. Extra goals use another catalog skill (not the same name twice on one person). One chat if at least one goal landed.

|                                    | N=50         | N=100              |
| ---------------------------------- | ------------ | ------------------ |
| A / B–F each                       | 25 / 5       | 50 / 10            |
| Completed / not started            | 45 / 5       | **90 / 10**        |
| Users who set goals                | 45           | **90**             |
| Goals set / achieved / in progress | 60 / 35 / 25 | **120 / 70 / 50**  |
| Tasks created / done / pending     | 90 / 55 / 35 | **180 / 110 / 70** |

Derived: M (assess PUTs) = A+B+C+D+E. Users with goals = M. Goals set = A + 2B + 2C + D + 2E. Green goals = A + 2B. Orange = 2C + D + 2E. Tasks created = A + 4B + 4C + D + 4E. Task PATCHes = A + 4B + 2C.

