## Chat close path

Same close path for every conversation: `POST /chat/stream` (`launch_id` null) → turns → GET session-notes → close_session stream → checkpoint → engagement-blocks. Recover `launch_id` from SSE or GET launches diff. Do not sleep for duration.

**Assessment (ready + full).** Any valid answers for Q1–Q5 (scores 1–5; checkbox strings from the lists above). Q6 any short note. Then API 8. No per-login answer table — this is only so the learner can set goals / look completed. Dashboard bars come from the `USERCOUNT` mix.

